<title>THAILAND: Asia Securities to decide on tender by June 10.</title>
<headline>Asia Securities to decide on tender by June 10.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Securities Trading Plc said on Thursday it has commissioned a financial advisor to assess a tender offer for its 49 percent stake and it will seek shareholders approval of its decision by June 10.</p>
<p>ABN-AMRO Hoare Govett Asia (Holdings) Ltd on Wednesday announced it would pay 35 baht for each of 63 million shares of AST in a deal worth $80 million.</p>
<p>Hoare Govett said in a statement on Thursday that AST is expected to recommend to shareholders its response to the offer by June 10.</p>
</text>
